* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# FIXES.md + done.log must be LF — fixes:sync regex is \n-anchored and
# silently no-ops on CRLF. The broad `* text=auto eol=lf` above already
# covers them, but the explicit rules below force text classification
# (no auto-detection) so a misconfigured editor can't slip CRLF in.
# See FIX-361.
docs/FIXES.md text eol=lf
docs/done.log text eol=lf
